  "title": "Pea Salad II",
  "description": "This salad has a definite sweetness about it. A bit of sugar is added to the dressing and sweet pickles are tossed in with the peas, onions, celery, eggs and cheese. Makes six generous servings.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Wehling"
